---
// EAxAI.net - English Main Hub (Static Web Hub)
// SEO & E-E-A-T Compliant
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>EAxAI.net — Gold Trading & Risk Management Hub</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Free trading utility tools, risk management calculators, and digital products discovery hub for XAUUSD traders. No membership required.">
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://eaxai.net" />
    <link rel="alternate" hreflang="th" href="https://eaxai.net" />
    <link rel="alternate" hreflang="en" href="https://eaxai.net" />
    <style>
        /* Base Styling aligned with the Navy-Gold Regime Theme */
        body {
            background-color: #0b132b;
            color: #ffffff;
            font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto 30px auto;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #1c2541;
            padding-bottom: 15px;
        }
        .logo {
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 24px;
            color: #ffffff;
        }
        .logo span {
            color: #d4af37;
        }
        .lang-switch a {
            color: #aaa;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin-left: 15px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .lang-switch a.active {
            color: #d4af37;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        main {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        .hero {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1c2541 0%, #0b132b 100%);
            border-radius: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            border: 1px solid #1c2541;
        }
        .hero h1 {
            color: #d4af37;
            margin-top: 0;
        }
        .grid-container {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }
        .card {
            background-color: #1c2541;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 20px;
            border: 1px solid #3a506b;
            transition: transform 0.2s;
        }
        .card h3 {
            color: #d4af37;
            margin-top: 0;
        }
        .card p {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #ccc;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
        .btn-link {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 10px;
            color: #d4af37;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        footer {
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 40px auto 0 auto;
            text-align: center;
            border-top: 1px solid #1c2541;
            padding-top: 20px;
        }
        footer p {
            font-size: 11px;
            color: #aaa;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin: 5px 0;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <div class="logo">EA<span>x</span>AI</div>
        <div class="lang-switch">
            <a href="/">TH</a>
            <a href="/en/" class="active">EN</a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main>
        <section class="hero">
            <h1>EA x AI — The Turtle Way</h1>
            <p>Gold Trading Knowledge & Technical Risk Management Solutions</p>
        </section>

        <!-- 4 Core Navigation / Service Slots -->
        <div class="grid-container">
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Risk Management</h3>
                <p>Calculate your precise position sizing and risk per trade to protect your capital effectively.</p>
                <a href="/en/tools/xauusd-risk-calculator/" class="btn-link">Open Tool →</a>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <h3>Trading Journal</h3>
                <p>Log and analyze your historical XAUUSD trading results to look for consistency and edge.</p>
                <a href="/en/tools/trading-journal/" class="btn-link">Open Journal →</a>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <h3>3 Free Tools Pack</h3>
                <p>Access our integrated utility kit: Compound Interest, Trading Checklist, and Market Session Converter.</p>
                <a href="/en/tools/" class="btn-link">Access Kit →</a>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <h3>Digital Products</h3>
                <p>Discover our automated Expert Advisors (EA-MT5), specialized trading e-books, podcasts, and media packs.</p>
                <a href="/en/products/digital/" class="btn-link">Browse Catalog →</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <!-- 5. Global Footer - Compliance & E-E-A-T Trust Building -->
    <footer>
        <p style="font-weight: 600; color: #fff;">© 2026 EAxAI.net - Static Web Hub Powered by Astro</p>
        <p><strong>Transparency Notice:</strong> This website offers free access to utility trading tools with no membership registration required and zero payment processing or checkout systems hosted on-site. We do not offer or run paid courses, academies, or financial training programs.</p>
        <p style="color: #d4af37;">⚖ The "EAxAI" trademark and brand logo are currently in the official application and pending approval phase under intellectual property law.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
